  - MCP acts as the "socket wrench," enabling individual agents to dynamically access external tools and invoke specific data sources with standardized permissions and authentication flows [ev-43]. [Source: ev-42]
  - In contrast, A2A serves as the "conversation between mechanics," facilitating discovery, collaboration, and state synchronization among multiple AI entities [ev-11]. [Source: ev-42]
